            "paragraph": "T\u00fcrkiye, located within the Mediterranean Basin, is considered one of the most vulnerable regions to the challenges posed by climate change. In the Mediterranean Basin, the impacts of climate change, such as difficulties in accessing water resources and a reduction in available water quantities, are experienced more acutely (Gampe et al. 2016). This situation indicates a significant shift toward adverse seasonal precipitation pattern changes and warmer climatic conditions in the region (Giorgi and Lionello 2008). Projections suggest a decline in precipitation, particularly in southern T\u00fcrkiye, accompanied by an increase in temperatures across the country. These factors negatively affect water resources, resulting in a reduction in water potential in the basins of southern T\u00fcrkiye. Projections indicate that during this century, water potential could decrease by up to 70% in the Konya Basin, 37% in the Mediterranean Basin, and 10% in the Euphrates and Tigris Basins (\u015een 2013).",
